[component]
name: For Each
category: Control Structures
description: Repeat the steps inside for every item in a list, text or other collection.

[interaction]
title For Each
text! var | Item variable | item
text! items | In (collection) | items
check index | Also give me the index | 0
text idx | Index variable | i

[template]
<PWCT:IF> <index>
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> For each <var> in <items> (index <idx>)
for <idx|ident>, <var|ident> in enumerate(<items>):
<PWCT:ELSE>
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> For each <var> in <items>
for <var|ident> in <items>:
<PWCT:ENDIF>
